&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A university degree in Engineering, Operations Management, or a related discipline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in Operational Excellence, Continuous Improvement, Process Engineering, or a similar role, ideally within a manufacturing or food production environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience driving cross-functional improvement projects and turning ideas into sustainable, measurable results&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of Lean Six Sigma methodologies and structured problem-solving; Green Belt certification is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical and stakeholder management skills, with the ability to use data to influence decisions and drive change across teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in German and English, with a proactive, hands-on mindset and a passion for continuous improvement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why you&#39;ll love it here:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Growth &amp;amp; Development: Internal training opportunities plus a yearly Learning &amp;amp; Development budget.&lt;/li&gt;
